WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
Hello, Everybody! My name is Markiplier, and welcome back to Doom.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.020
 

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.080
Now there's some story here, right here

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:10.300
"Olivia Pierce, the cult leader of the UAC is trying to open a gateway into their dimension..."

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.360
So first off: I WAS RIGHT!!! *shock*

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:19.360
There is a frickin' cult aspect of this organization, *quick intake of air* and I don't know why every single thing in the future

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.800
turns into a cult eventually... It happens in Dead Space, it happens in a LOT of other games...

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:30.720
But anyway, "She wants to help bring about the end of this world. Another lost soul fallen under Hell's control."

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:37.040
"Olivia overclocked the Argent Tower, using it to drill a hole into the Hellscape and let Hell's army through."

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.000
"You need to shut down the Argent Tower before it breaks through into their world..."

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.520
"by disabling the energy filters located throughout the surface complex."

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:50.520
So, my guess... Thee arr- the Argent Tower is some way to harness the energy of Hell...

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.380
To be able to use it for our own purposes.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:58.600
And that was kind of the point of this Mars facility.          Samuel Hayden: Olivia is using the tower to drill a hole into the doorway into their world.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:04.200
Samuel Hayden: You can prevent her from opening the gate by disabling the tower's induction filters.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.860
Okay. That's cool. I'ma da do that and that'll be really nice. Uhh...

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.140
But the first thing I'm gonna do is I'm gonna upgrade my weapons.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:17.200
I'ma gonna hold off on upgrading this because I want one more token to be able to find the security buzzing feature.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.860
Which is very nice, I suppose.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:21.300
But anyway, I want...

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:25.200
"Can be fired indefinitely without requiring a reload" that sounds awesome!

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.720
But I wanna do something here because I need a little bit more...

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:30.060
*completely loses train of thought*

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh that would be nice!

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:37.500
"Removing the loading time for an explosive shot" because that, that was kind of annoying in that...

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:42.120
If I want to blow something up with this, I want to just be able to just switch to it and then BLOW it up right away.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.940
So that's going to be a little bit of a benefit to me.

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:48.480
I am low *brain farts* on ammo across the board, so someone is about to get CHAINSAWED!

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:51.580
Who wants to be a volunteer!?

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:55.560
*crazily* I have a lot of chainsaw to share with you guys. Anybody? Any takers?

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:56.060
no?

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:57.300
No?

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.140
Alright. FINE.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:02.180
UAC Spokesperson: Untethered crossdimensional activity is a frequent occurrence outside of the base.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:06.760
UAC Spokesperson: So it is recommended that workers buddy up when journeying onto the Martian surface.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:12.040
